{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22432","headline":"因沐感发寄朗上人二首 一 · 白居易","name":"因沐感发寄朗上人二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年长身转慵，百事无所欲。\n乃至头上发，经年方一沐。\n沐稀发苦落，一沐仍半秃。\n短鬓经霜蓬，老面辞春木。\n强年过犹近，衰相来何速。\n应是烦恼多，心焦血不足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}